{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ModelsOfQous.Instanton","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ModelsOfQous.Instanton","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Structures","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.NatTrans","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.ContinuousMap.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Geometry.Manifold.IsManifold.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.InnerProductSpace.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.ExteriorAlgebra.Basic"],"declarations":23,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.IsIrreducible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.IsIrreducible","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L105-L109","doc":"A connection is **irreducible** if the space of its covariant-constant\nadjoint sections is trivial (at most one element, necessarily zero). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.self_dual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.self_dual","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L103-L103","doc":"**Self-duality**: when `dim_ℝ H = 4` (CR dimension `n = 2`), the\ncurvature restricted to `H` is self-dual with respect to the Hodge star.\nThis is the Bogomolny bound: YM minimisation forces `F⁻ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.yang_mills_minimises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.yang_mills_minimises","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L99-L99","doc":"Yang–Mills minimisation: the energy is at most that of any\nperturbation (abstractly: `YM(A) ≤ YM(A')` for nearby `A'`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.yangMillsEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.yangMillsEnergy","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L96-L96","doc":"The Yang–Mills energy functional `YM(A) = ∫_M ‖F_A|_H‖² θ ∧ (dθ)ⁿ`.\nReturns the energy evaluated on `curvature_H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.hodgeStar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.hodgeStar","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L91-L91","doc":"When `n = 2` (`dim_ℝ H = 4`), the Hodge star on `Ad(P)`-valued\n2-forms restricted to `H`, determined by the Webster metric `g_θ`\nand the complex structure `J`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.parallelAdjointSections","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.parallelAdjointSections","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L87-L87","doc":"The type of covariant-constant sections of `Ad(P)` w.r.t. this\nconnection: `{ s ∈ Γ(Ad(P)) | D_A s = 0 }`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.curvature_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.curvature_H","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L84-L84","doc":"Curvature `F_A` restricted to `H = ker θ`.\nFull type: an Ad(P)-valued 2-form on `H`. Modelled as `C(M, ℝ)` —\nthe real-valued proxy captures the norm ‖F_A|_H‖ at each point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.connectionData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.connectionData","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Abstract connection data (gauge potential).\nFull type: a 𝔤-valued 1-form on `P`. Modelled as `C(M, ℝ)` —\nthe real-valued proxy captures the norm ‖A‖ at each point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection.mk","kind":"ctor","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L76-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.InstantonConnection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.InstantonConnection","kind":"structure","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L69-L103","doc":"**Instanton connection** on a principal bundle `P` over a CR manifold.\n\nWhen `dim_ℝ H = 4`, the curvature restricted to `H = ker θ` is self-dual:\n`F_A|_H = *_H F_A|_H`.  More generally, it minimises the Yang–Mills\nfunctional `∫_M ‖F_A|_H‖² θ ∧ (dθ)ⁿ`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:instanton}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:instanton","label":"ex:instanton","md":"quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.reeb_preserves_contact","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.reeb_preserves_contact","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L65-L65","doc":"The Reeb field preserves the contact form: `θ(ξ(p)) = θ(p)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.reebField","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.reebField","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The Reeb vector field `ξ`, characterised by `ι_ξ dθ = 0` and `θ(ξ) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.contact_nondeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.contact_nondeg","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L61-L61","doc":"**Non-degeneracy**: `θ` does not vanish identically. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.contactForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.contactForm","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The contact form `θ` represented abstractly as a continuous 1-form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.rs_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.rs_sum","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.s","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.s","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.r","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Levi form signature `(r, s)` with `r + s = n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.n_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.n_pos","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.n","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L52-L52","doc":"CR dimension `n ≥ 1`; real dimension of `M` is `2n + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.topM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.topM","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.M","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The underlying smooth manifold carrier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CRManifoldData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CRManifoldData","kind":"structure","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/instanton.lean#L40-L65","doc":"**CR manifold data** for the ℂ realisation (ℝ ground ring).\n\nRe-declared from the library module\n`QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CRRealisation` so this sibling is a\nself-contained compilation unit — importing `CRRealisation` would\ncollide with this block's own `InstantonConnection` declaration.\nKeep field-for-field in sync with the library. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:c-quantum-universe","label":"ex:c-quantum-universe","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/c-quantum-universe.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}